; claude: AutoCAD's drawing and command line (AutoCAD, Autodesk, 1982;
; see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_cad.md): the geometry of crossings
; (Cad_geom), entities on layers and blocks (Cad_drawing), OFFSET, TRIM,
; EXTEND, FILLET (Cad_edit), object snaps (Cad_snap), the DXF file
; (Dxf), and the session, the command line as a machine that asks and
; is answered (Cad_session). Used by TinyAutoCAD. A private library,
; installed as part of elm_playground: pure OCaml.
